    "title": "Pompano Beach Window Firm's Bankruptcy Leaves 400+ Homeowners Without Hurricane Protection - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Livi Miller ,\n14 hours ago Christie McGowen and her husband signed a contract with BNT Services in late February 2026 and paid an $8,356 deposit, expecting new hurricane-rated windows and doors for their home. Months later, the windows never came, the company filed for bankruptcy, and McGowen says she is one of more than 400 customers left in the same bind. Read full article",
